                                "classes": [
                                  "silex-default-text"
                                ],
                                "components": [
                                  {
                                    "content": "Hello! I'm Alex Henson, and I'm a second-year PhD student in the Department of Geography and Environment at the University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill and a Graduate Research Assistant at the Southeast Regional Climate Center (SERCC) .",
                                    "type": "textnode"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "tagName": "br",
                                    "void": true
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "tagName": "br",
                                    "void": true
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "content": "I earned a B.S. (May 2025) in Environmental Sciences with a Quantitative Energy Systems Track from the University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill. Generally, I am interested in leveraging large gridded climate products to model fungal diseases or other climate-sensitive vectors. Ultimately I would like to use these datasets to develop tools that can help predict plant disease prevalence and the optimal time for spraying crops.",
                                    "type": "textnode"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "attributes": {
                                      "draggable": "true",
                                      "id": "i2f7j"
                                    },
                                    "tagName": "br",
                                    "type": "default",
                                    "void": true
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "attributes": {
                                      "draggable": "true",
                                      "id": "ir2nj"
                                    },
                                    "tagName": "br",
                                    "type": "default",
                                    "void": true
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "content": "In addition to my research, I am currently the Assistant Director of the Mascot Program at UNC after serving as the UNC mascot myself for 4 years.",
                                    "type": "textnode"
                                  }
                                ],
                                "type": "text"
                              }
